{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33316","headline":"越溪女 · 于濆","name":"越溪女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会稽山上云，化作越溪人。\n枉破吴王国，徒爲西子身。\n江边浣纱伴，黄金扼双腕。\n倏忽不相期，思倾赵飞燕。\n妾家基业薄，空有如花面。\n嫁尽绿窗人，独自盘金线。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}